 	  See Documentation/admin-guide/mm/soft-dirty.rst for more details.
 
+config KCOMPRESSD
+	bool "Kcompressd: asynchronous swap-out compression for kswapd"
+	depends on SWAP
+	help
+	  Kcompressd-Unofficial 0.5 (firelzrd), after Kcompressd by Qun-Wei Lin
+	  (MediaTek). kswapd hands anonymous pages bound for a synchronous
+	  swap device (zram) to a per-node kthread, so LRU scanning is not
+	  stalled behind compression. Runtime control: vm.kcompressd is the
+	  queue depth (0 = off, synchronous as without this option).
+
+	  If unsure, say N.
+
